        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "116 Springhill Avenue, Blackrock, Co. Dublin\r\nFor Sale by Private Treaty\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nAdvised Minimum Value (AMV): €895,000\r\n\r\nProperty Type: Extended Semi-Detached House with Converted Attic\r\n\r\nBedrooms: 3 Bedrooms + Converted Attic / Office Space\r\n\r\nBathrooms: 3 Bathrooms (Downstairs WC, Master En-Suite, Main Family Bathroom)\r\n\r\nHeating: Gas-Fired Central Heating (GFCH)\r\n\r\nWindows: Double-Glazed Windows Throughout\r\n\r\nParking: Generous Off-Street Driveway (4–5 Vehicles)\r\n\r\nKW Team Castles are delighted to present 116 Springhill Avenue to the Blackrock market — AMV €895,000.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of South Co. Dublin’s most desirable residential enclaves, this exceptional semi-detached home offers an outstanding balance of extensive indoor living, modern upgrades, and rare outdoor plot scale.\r\n\r\nDistinguished by an impressive 80ft long rear garden, a light-filled ground-floor extension, and a versatile converted attic, this property represents a turnkey opportunity for growing families seeking space, connectivity, and coastal proximity.\r\n\r\nProperty Description\r\nGround Floor\r\nThe property opens via a welcoming entrance hall complete with a dedicated cloakroom and an under-stairs guest WC. To the front sits a warm, light-filled reception room featuring double-glazed windows that flood the space with natural light.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the house expands into an impressive modern extension housing an open-plan kitchen and dining area. Overhead, three Velux roof windows draw in natural light throughout the day. Double doors open out onto a low-maintenance patio area laid with synthetic turf—ideal for outdoor entertaining and alfresco dining.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nUpstairs accommodates three well-proportioned bedrooms:\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom: Generous double room complemented by a private en-suite bathroom.\r\n\r\nRear Bedroom: Spacious double bedroom overlooking the vast garden.\r\n\r\nThird Bedroom: Versatile room ideal as a child’s bedroom or nursery.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom: Modern family suite equipped with both a full bath and a tiled shower unit.\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion\r\nA full staircase leads to a bright converted attic, adding invaluable multi-purpose square footage. Illuminated by two Velux windows and featuring convenient built-in eaves storage, this high-functionality space serves perfectly as a dedicated home office, study, or hobby room.\r\n\r\nGrounds & Exterior\r\nFront: An unusually expansive, low-maintenance pebbled front driveway providing off-street parking for 4 to 5 vehicles.\r\n\r\nRear: A substantial 80ft rear garden offering endless room for children to play, gardening, or outdoor relaxation. Includes a synthetic grass patio area and a solid Barna garden shed for extra storage.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nAMV: €895,000\r\n\r\nPresented by: KW Team Castles\r\n\r\nPrime Blackrock Address: 116 Springhill Avenue\r\n\r\nConverted Attic: Multi-purpose space with 2 Velux windows and eaves storage\r\n\r\nSubstantial Off-Street Parking: Low-maintenance pebbled driveway for 4–5 cars\r\n\r\nLight-Filled Extension: Open-plan kitchen/dining room featuring 3 Velux windows\r\n\r\n3 Bathrooms: Downstairs guest WC, master en-suite, and main family bathroom\r\n\r\nExpansive Outdoor Space: 80ft rear garden with synthetic grass patio and Barna shed\r\n\r\nGFCH & Double-Glazed Windows throughout\r\n\r\nBER: D (Number 107071896)\r\n\r\nLocation & Amenities\r\nSpringhill Avenue enjoys an enviable location close to the heart of Blackrock, Deansgrange, and surrounding South Dublin hubs:\r\n\r\nTransport: Close proximity to the N11 Quality Bus Corridor (QBC), the M50 motorway network, and local DART stations providing fast access to Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nEducation: Surrounded by top-tier primary and secondary schools including Blackrock College, St. Andrew's College, Carysfort National School, Hollypark, and Loreto Foxrock.\r\n\r\nShopping & Leisure: Minutes from Blackrock Village, Newtownpark Avenue amenities, Frascati Shopping Centre, Carysfort Park, and coastal walks along Dublin Bay.\r\n\r\nViewing Details\r\nStrictly by private appointment with KW Team Castles. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
